    "topic": "告警规则与SLO",
    "title": "交付快慢窗口燃烧率分级、低流量抑制与降级交接",
    "answer": "```yaml\ngroups:\n- name: multiwindow-budget-routing\n  interval: 1m\n  rules:\n  - record: service:error_burn:5m\n    expr: ((sum by(service)(rate(errors_total[5m])) / sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[5m])))\n      / 0.001) and on(service) (sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[5m])) > 0)\n  - record: service:requests_increase:5m\n    expr: sum by(service)(increase(requests_total[5m]))\n  - record: service:error_burn:30m\n    expr: ((sum by(service)(rate(errors_total[30m])) / sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[30m])))\n      / 0.001) and on(service) (sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[30m])) > 0)\n  - record: service:requests_increase:30m\n    expr: sum by(service)(increase(requests_total[30m]))\n  - record: service:error_burn:2h\n    expr: ((sum by(service)(rate(errors_total[2h])) / sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[2h])))\n      / 0.001) and on(service) (sum by(service)(rate(requests_total[2h])) > 0)\n  - record: service:requests_increase:2h\n    expr: sum by(service)(increase(requests_total[2h]))\n  - alert: ErrorBudgetPage\n    expr: (service:error_burn:5m > 14.4) and on(service) (service:error_burn:30m >\n      14.4) and on(service) (service:requests_increase:5m >= 100) and on(service)\n      (service:requests_increase:30m >= 1000)\n    for: 2m\n    labels:\n      severity: page\n    annotations:\n      summary: Fast sustained error-budget burn\n  - alert: ErrorBudgetTicket\n    expr: ((service:error_burn:30m > 6) and on(service) (service:error_burn:2h > 6)\n      and on(service) (service:requests_increase:30m >= 1000) and on(service) (service:requests_increase:2h\n      >= 5000)) unless on(service) ((service:error_burn:5m > 14.4) and on(service)\n      (service:error_burn:30m > 14.4) and on(service) (service:requests_increase:5m\n      >= 100) and on(service) (service:requests_increase:30m >= 1000))\n    for: 5m\n    labels:\n      severity: ticket\n    annotations:\n      summary: Slow sustained error-budget burn\n```\n\n燃烧率是错误比例/0.001，并非错误比例本身。page/ticket/healthy稳定燃烧率分别20/8/0.1。recent短窗口高但长窗口不足，old长历史高但最近窗口已恢复，都不应在验收时刻误报。single的错误比例可100%，但真实请求增量远不足门槛。快速渠道和慢速渠道互斥，ticket按page条件抑制而不是等待page已经firing。page服务在t125后零错误，t127的5m燃烧率已降到10，低于14.4快速阈值，快速条件解除（不必等到整个窗口零增长）；慢速窗口仍较高，因此ticket从t127重新pending，到t132才firing。不能为了“恢复”直接删除所有慢窗口证据，也不能立刻降级通知绕过5m持续时间。这里是压缩固定材料与既定策略，阈值不是对所有生产SLO的通用推荐。\n\n### 原题原理\n交付成功定义、请求总量口径、SLO周期和多窗口阈值推导。按错误预算消耗计算燃烧率，并把最小事件量或低流量策略明确写入合同，不能用平均每分钟请求量代替真实分母。短长窗口同时验证快速故障与持续退化，零请求和采集缺失分别处理。验收全失败低流量、正常高流量少量失败及故障恢复，记录通知可操作性。若历史样本不足，阈值标为试运行并限定通知渠道；回退告警时保留缺失检测，不能为消噪关闭全部服务健康信号。对低流量服务加入最小事件数判断，并单列零流量与缺数据。",
